OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detectorist finds second
OL,4,ABronze Age hoard in Scottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA metal detectorist has revealed his
OL,7,F"quite extraordinary" discovery of a
OL,8,Fsecond Bronze Age hoard in the Scottish
OL,9,FBorders.
OL,11,FMariusz Stepien found his latest haul
OL,12,Fof 3,000-year-old treasure in 2022 at a
OL,13,Fspot seven miles from where he
OL,14,Fdiscovered the Peebles Hoard in 2020.
OL,16,FDubbed the Blyth Hoard, the artefacts
OL,17,Fdate from the Late Bronze Age between
OL,18,F1150BC to 850BC.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
