OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detectorist finds second
OL,4,ABronze Age hoard in Scottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey feature two bronze axe-heads, and
OL,7,Fclay moulds potentially used to make
OL,8,Fsome of the unique bronze fittings in
OL,9,Fthe nearby Peebles Hoard - which was
OL,10,Fsaved for the nation in 2024.
